WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
Xiaocui, I don’t dislike you

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,960
When I just woke up and saw a long snake, I was startled.

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,960
Go back to your cave and call you if I need anything.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,220
It’s better to be young and energetic in the morning

5
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,660
What happened in the dream yesterday?

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,100
Lin Yueling will be fine

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,620
Sun Tieniu won't pester her anymore, right?

8
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:15,900
That blessing is soothing to the mind

9
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,900
Only when she falls asleep can we gather ghosts in our dreams

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,460
Sun Tieniu only fell asleep at night

11
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,820
We can only accept her in our dreams

12
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,500
She has been sent to the underworld by Master Ma

13
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,620
She has been on the run for nearly a hundred years. She will suffer this time.

14
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:29,870
Master Liu Master Xiaotie

15
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,230
I slept very well last night

16
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:32,630
This is a hindrance in doing things

17
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,530
Why wasn't she dreaming?

18
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:37,710
My Ma Xian erased the memory of her dream

19
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:40,900
Knowing too much would be bad for her

20
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,060
I feel uneasy after charging so much

21
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:45,380
Xiaotie, please watch independently in the future. Remember

22
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,340
Ghosts can also lie

23
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,540
If you're not sure whether it's true or not, let your ghost fairy check her life.

24
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:49,900
There are records in the underworld

25
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:52,780
Lao Liu, don’t you already want to leave me behind?

26
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,740
That won't happen

27
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,740
But I can't teach you forever

28
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:57,020
Can you believe it then?

29
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,020
There are only ghosts and immortals in Tangkou, your home
